            <title>[LU-21087] sanity-lnet test_257: Detected N dropped messages - expect 0</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21087</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;sanity-lnet test_257 fails now and then with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Detected 36 dropped messages - expect 0
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Seen on master: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/438ec691-f1f9-47f9-adfc-8b2d2a01d822" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/438ec691-f1f9-47f9-adfc-8b2d2a01d822&lt;/a&gt; (2026-11-01, 36 drops).&lt;br/&gt;
Also on a review run of change 69503, which touches only lfs/liblustreapi and the ZFS build check, no LNet code: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/4408dc80-327d-47f0-a4a1-372a78621a78" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/4408dc80-327d-47f0-a4a1-372a78621a78&lt;/a&gt; (16 drops, review-dne-zfs-part-2, el9.8).&lt;br/&gt;
The same session passed test_257 on four changes stacked on 69503.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Rate: master 1 of 21 runs in 90 days; lustre-reviews 0 of 92 in 30 days before this one.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_257 starts lnet_selftest through the router, waits 5 s, runs "lnetctl set routing 0" on the router, waits for lst, then sums drop_count from "lnetctl net show -v; lnetctl peer show -v" on the router and expects 0.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
